<!DOCTYPE html>
@{
    Layout = null;
}
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Terms for Payvand link shortening, QR codes, analytics, and abuse reports." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" asp-append-version="true">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" asp-append-version="true">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="@($"{Context.Request.Scheme}://{Context.Request.Host}/Terms_Privacy/Terms")" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Payvand" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Terms of use | Payvand" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Terms for the Payvand link shortener, dashboard, analytics, and QR codes." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="@($"{Context.Request.Scheme}://{Context.Request.Host}/Terms_Privacy/Terms")" />
    <title>Terms of use | Payvand</title>
    <script src="~/js/theme.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/Fonts/Vazirmatn.css" asp-append-version="true">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/Terms&Privacy/Terms.css" asp-append-version="true">
    <link href="/css/Home/Contact.css" asp-append-version="true" rel="stylesheet" />


    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/theme.css" asp-append-version="true" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/english.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <!-- هدر استاندارد -->
    <header class="standard-header">
        <div class="header-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">
                <span>Payvand</span>
            </a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="@Url.Action("Privacy","Terms_Privacy")">Privacy Policy</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- محتوای اصلی -->
    <main class="terms-container">
        <header class="page-header">
            <h1 class="page-title">Payvand terms of use</h1>
            <p class="page-subtitle">Terms for link shortening, the dashboard, analytics, and QR codes</p>
            <div class="effective-date">Last updated: May 5, 2026</div>
        </header>

        <div class="notice-card">
            <h3><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> Important notice</h3>
            <p>By using Payvand's website and services, you confirm that you have read and agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="section" id="intro">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">1</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">About the service</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Payvand lets users turn long URLs into shorter links, manage them in a dashboard, create QR codes, and view click analytics.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="account">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">2</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">User accounts</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Some features, including link management, detailed analytics, and QR code creation, require sign in. Accounts may use a mobile number, password, or one-time code. You are responsible for keeping your account and credentials secure.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="guest-use">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">3</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Guest use</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Some features are available without registering. Guest link creation may be limited to prevent abuse. Cookies or guest identifiers may be used to manage these limits.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="allowed-use">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">4</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Permitted use</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>You may use Payvand to shorten lawful URLs, share links, create QR codes, and view your link analytics. The person who creates a link is responsible for its destination content.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="prohibited-use">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">5</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Prohibited use</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <div class="prohibited">
                    <p>You must not use Payvand for:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Phishing, fraud, malware, or spam</li>
                        <li>Violating others' rights or distributing illegal content</li>
                        <li>Bypassing limits or disrupting the service</li>
                        <li>Linking to content that may lead to legal enforcement</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="moderation">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">6</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Link review and removal</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Payvand may review links for safety. If a link is dangerous, reported, subject to a legal order, or violates these terms, we may remove or disable the link or restrict access to the account.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="analytics">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">7</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Click data and analytics</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>To provide analytics, we may record click counts, times, browser, device, operating system, IP address, country, city, and referrer. This information is used for analytics, security, and service improvement.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="qr-code">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">8</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">QR Code</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Users may create QR codes and customize their color, size, or logo. Users are responsible for any images, logos, or content used in their QR codes.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="reports">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">9</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Abuse reports</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Users may report suspicious or abusive links through the report form. Payvand reviews reports and takes appropriate action when needed.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="availability">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">10</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Service availability</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Payvand aims to provide a reliable service, but uninterrupted or error-free access is not guaranteed. Maintenance, updates, technical issues, or security needs may cause temporary outages.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="responsibility">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">11</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Responsibilities</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Payvand is not responsible for the content of linked websites. Each user is responsible for links they create and must ensure their destinations are lawful and safe.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="changes">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">12</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Changes to these terms</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>These terms may change. The updated version will appear here. Continued use of the service means acceptance of the new terms.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="contact">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-number">13</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>For questions, support, or legal reports, contact us through the website form or email <a href="mailto:payvandweb@gmail.com">payvandweb@gmail.com</a> to get in touch.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- فوتر ساده -->
    <footer class="simple-footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-grid">
                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h4>Payvand</h4>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
                        A smarter way to share links
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h4>Documents</h4>
                    <ul class="footer-links">
                        <li><a href="@Url.Action("Privacy", "Terms_Privacy")">Privacy Policy</a></li>
                        <li><a href="@Url.Action("Terms", "Terms_Privacy")">Terms of use</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="footer-section">
                    <h4>Contact</h4>
                    <ul class="footer-links">
                            <li><a href="mailto:payvandweb@gmail.com">payvandweb@gmail.com</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" id="ContactBtn">Contact form</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>© 2026 Payvand. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
    <!-- Contact Modal -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="contactModal">
        <div class="modal-container">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <button class="close-button" id="closeModal">&times;</button>
                <h2 class="modal-title">Contact us</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <form id="contactForm">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label" for="name">Full name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" class="form-control" placeholder="Enter your full name" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label" for="email">Email</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" class="form-control" placeholder="Enter a valid email address" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label" for="subject">Subject</label>
                        <input type="text" id="subject" class="form-control" placeholder="Enter your subject" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label" for="message">Message</label>
                        <textarea id="message" class="form-control" placeholder="Write your message..." required></textarea>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="submit-button">Send message</button>
                </form>
                <div class="contact-info">
                    <div class="info-item"><img src="/Images/Icons/Email.png" class="icon icon-sm" alt=""><span>Email: info@payvand.ir</span></div>
                    <div class="info-item"><img src="/Images/Icons/Phone.png" class="icon icon-sm" alt=""><span>Phone: 021-12345678</span></div>
                    <div class="info-item"><img src="/Images/Icons/Location.png" class="icon icon-sm" alt=""><span>Location: Karaj, Iran</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    


    <script src="/js/Home/Contact.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    <script src="/js/Home/Contact.js" asp-append-version="true" ></script>
   
</body>
</html>

